:33.924">your </span><span begin="00:33.924" end="00:34.823">heart </span><span begin="00:34.823" end="00:35.643">through </span><span begin="00:35.643" end="00:39.743">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.273" end="00:50.971"><span begin="00:41.273" end="00:41.623">I </span><span begin="00:41.623" end="00:42.043">know </span><span begin="00:42.043" end="00:42.443">I </span><span begin="00:42.443" end="00:44.023">always </span><span begin="00:44.023" end="00:45.132">said </span><span begin="00:45.132" end="00:45.532">that </span><span begin="00:45.532" end="00:45.842">I </span><span begin="00:45.842" end="00:46.302">could </span><span begin="00:46.302" end="00:47.102">never </span><span begin="00:47.102" end="00:47.842">hurt </span><span begin="00:47.842" end="00:50.971">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.620" end="01:02.368"><span begin="00:53.620" end="00:53.689">Well </span><span begin="00:53.689" end="00:53.859">this </span><span begin="00:53.859" end="00:54.239">is </span><span begin="00:54.239" end="00:54.848">the </span><span begin="00:54.848" end="00:55.588">very </span><span begin="00:55.588" end="00:56.318">very </span><span begin="00:56.318" end="00:57.958">last </span><span begin="00:57.958" end="00:58.258">time </span><span begin="00:58.258" end="00:58.658">I'm </span><span begin="00:58.658" end="00:59.428">ever </span><span begin="00:59.428" end="01:00.118">going </span><span begin="01:00.118" end="01:00.308">to </span><span begin="01:00.308" end="01:02.368">soon</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.995" end="01:19.343"><span begin="01:15.995" end="01:16.195">But </span><span begin="01:16.195" end="01:16.335">I </span><span begin="01:16.335" end="01:16.704">know </span><span begin="01:16.704" end="01:16.864">that </span><span begin="01:16.864" end="01:17.273">I'll </span><span begin="01:17.273" end="01:17.703">be </span><span begin="01:17.703" end="01:19.343">happier</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.583" end="01:24.073"><